{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c497","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06ff2-73b2-7750-92a2-8ff950295c9d"},"sequence":166,"recorded_at":1780531400000327,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"1b11d441-f4bd-4331-a485-e0ecf0af0397","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"1b11d441-f4bd-4331-a485-e0ecf0af0397","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"1b11d441-f4bd-4331-a485-e0ecf0af0397"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"ff33131b-344b-4fbe-ae12-b10324e6d799"},"task_id":"ff33131b-344b-4fbe-ae12-b10324e6d799","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"ff33131b-344b-4fbe-ae12-b10324e6d799","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-4-1\",\n  \"command\": \"grep -n \\\"closed-set\\\\|closed set\\\\|P11\\\\|C20\\\\|legacyForward\\\\|HistoricalTranslation\\\\|conformanceOperations\\\" LOGBOOK.md | head -20\",\n  \"description\": \"Find logbook false claim\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"469:- DISCLOSURE, not repaired here: `WorkspaceSnapshot.members` and `GitIndex.entries` enforce uniqueness the pinned document declares nowhere — an equal `workspace_id` and an equal `(path, stage)` pair respectively. Both sit in `closed_shapes.go`, in sections owned by `TASK-260830-uqnwmi`, inside a reviewed and accepted candidate. They are recorded as disclosed strengthenings with their exact undeclared refusal and routed, and the disclosed set is asserted exactly against the artifact in both directions so a fourth cannot appear silently.\\n738:- BOUNDS (carried forward, not dropped): the inventory kills every arm-deleting mutant by construction, so post-leaf-3 mutation scores are NOT comparable to leaf 2's 91/95 — stated in the inventory file's Stated bounds block and here. Attribution drift survives via the entry+code fallback — live example `CheckTransition`'s dead `\\\"operation vocabulary\\\"` arm resolving through `ParseOperation`'s test — also stated there. Declined closure: P13 (empty-ID `ProjectToLegacy` still refuses, different wire code). P11 (legacy escape name) is no longer declined: C20 (`legacyForward` gains `\\\"screen\\\"`) is killed by `TestLegacyReverseProjectionExistsOnlyForThePair`, so the closed-set property is pinned.\\n748:- FIX (G4): new `TestDerivedVocabulariesAreExactlyTheAdmittedSets` derives all four parser vocabularies (states, operations, effects, transports) from switch-case lists resolved through string consts, both directions plus size, and pins `conformanceOperations` to the derived operation set — the \\\"pinned by\\\" citation now holds. Refused samples restated as sampling bounds over the unbounded string domain and extended with the reviewer's exact survivor strings (`detached`, `detach`, `input_reopened`, `ssh_tunnel`), each now behaviorally refused.\\n749:- BOUNDS (recorded, not closed): W11 (DigestFile allowlist is function-wide, no detail pin), W13 (bespoke error types outside both spellings), mismatchf format-verb interpolation (derivation now fatals on any constructor call without exactly one string-literal argument — zero such sites today; vet catches non-constant formats). P11 stale bound dropped (C20 killed); P13 declined closure stands.\\n752:- SCOPE: `internal/terminalbackend/conformance_test.go` (G1/G3-comment/G4), `internal_pin_test.go` (G3 pin), `refusal_arm_inventory_test.go` (G2 twin + single-arg assertion + bounds), `LOGBOOK.md` (this entry + P11 correction). No production change, no arm-table change, 193/193 undisturbed.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2510,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 628,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
